<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The Bible testifies concerning the Lord Jesus;</l><l>The Bible makes man wise, wise unto salvation;</l><l>The Bible causes man to be regenerated;</l><l>Our spiritual milk, our bread of life;</l><l>It makes us all complete.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
